Package: rustima
Title: Seasonal ARIMA Models Powered by 'Rust'
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("zongseung", email = "new9279@gachon.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Authors of the bundled Rust crates", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "See inst/COPYRIGHTS for authorship and license details"))
Description: Fits seasonal autoregressive integrated moving average models
    with optional regression terms using a shared 'Rust' engine. Provides
    Kalman likelihood evaluation, numerical optimization via 'Basin', forecasting,
    independent batch fits, and automatic ARIMA order selection without a
    'Python' runtime.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS for the bundled Rust crates. Original
    copyright and license notices are retained in src/rust/vendor.tar.xz
    and inst/extendr.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: stats
SystemRequirements: Cargo (>= 1.87), rustc (>= 1.87), xz
URL: https://github.com/zongseung/rustima
BugReports: https://github.com/zongseung/rustima/issues
